# Emitted Messages

```block
node_modules/package-b/node_modules/shared-config/node_modules/source-config/recommended.json configuration ━━━━━━━━━━

  × Biome resolved multiple versions of shared-config.
  
  i This is an error for Biome because it doesn't know which version to use. Extended configurations are applied in order, and a fixed configuration could be overridden by one that is bugged.
  
  i The first reference from node_modules/package-a/biome.json resolves to node_modules/package-a/node_modules/shared-config/node_modules/source-config/recommended.json from shared-config@1.0.0.
  
  i The conflicting reference from node_modules/package-b/biome.json resolves to node_modules/package-b/node_modules/shared-config/node_modules/source-config/recommended.json from shared-config@2.0.0.
  
  i Biome can't determine which configuration should be used.
  

```
